+OBJECTIVE
+
+Fully restore and upgrade HackerzArt’s frontend into a premium, visually distinctive, production-quality design system.
+
+The current UI has regressed into unstyled HTML, meaning:
+- Tailwind is not properly applied
+- layout/globals may not be wired
+- components are not being used effectively
+
+We must fix the foundation AND rebuild the visual system in one pass.
+
+---
+
+PHASE 1 — FIX STYLING PIPELINE (CRITICAL)
+
+1. Ensure Tailwind is fully working:
+   - tailwind.config.ts has correct content paths:
+     ./app/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}
+     ./components/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}
+
+2. Ensure app/globals.css includes:
+   @tailwind base;
+   @tailwind components;
+   @tailwind utilities;
+
+3. Ensure layout.tsx imports globals.css correctly
+
+4. Ensure layout.tsx wraps app properly:
+   <html>
+   <body className="bg-black text-white antialiased">
+     {children}
+   </body>
+   </html>
+
+5. Fix any missing or broken PostCSS config
+
+---
+
+PHASE 2 — REBUILD DESIGN SYSTEM
+
+We are not restoring a generic site.
+
+We are building:
+👉 a premium cyber-art product
+👉 inspired by:
+   - 90s hacker / keygen aesthetics
+   - ASCII terminal visuals
+   - Noaerth premium design system
+
+---
+
+GLOBAL VISUAL SYSTEM
+
+- deep black / navy background
+- layered gradient lighting
+- subtle glow effects
+- premium spacing
+- rounded cards
+- strong typography
+- mono accents for ASCII
+- clean modern sans for main UI
+
+---
+
+PHASE 3 — HOMEPAGE REDESIGN
+
+Rebuild app/page.tsx into structured sections:
+
+1. HEADER
+- clean nav
+- spaced
+- subtle hover states
+- premium feel
+
+2. HERO (MOST IMPORTANT)
+
+LEFT:
+- big headline:
+  "Turn signal into identity."
+- subtext:
+  "The premium engine for machine-rendered monochrome systems."
+
+RIGHT:
+- ASCII panel (styled)
+- glowing border
+- dark panel background
+- overflow hidden
+
+CTA:
+- primary: Start Creating
+- secondary: Explore Gallery
+
+---
+
+3. ASCII PANEL COMPONENT
+
+Create reusable component:
+- rounded-xl
+- border-white/10
+- bg-black/60
+- backdrop-blur
+- mono font
+- small text
+- scrollable
+- glowing effect
+
+---
+
+4. FEATURE CARDS
+
+Replace plain sections with premium cards:
+- gradient overlays
+- hover lift
+- rounded-xl
+- border + glow
+- consistent spacing
+
+---
+
+5. STYLE SYSTEM
+
+Create section:
+- Hacker
+- Keygen
+- Gothic
+- Baroque
+- Terminal
+
+Each card:
+- slightly different color tone
+- premium feel
+- NOT neon spam
+
+---
+
+6. FOOTER
+
+- minimal
+- clean
+- subtle Noaerth reference
+
+---
+
+PHASE 4 — COMPONENTIZATION
+
+Create or refactor:
+
+components/ui/Button.tsx
+components/ui/Card.tsx
+components/AsciiPanel.tsx
+components/Hero.tsx
+components/Header.tsx
+
+---
+
+PHASE 5 — QUALITY BAR
+
+The site should feel:
+- NOT generic SaaS
+- NOT Tailwind template
+- premium
+- intentional
+- clean
+- visually distinct
+- investor-ready
+
+---
+
+TECH RULES
+
+- do not break build
+- keep Next.js App Router valid
+- do not add heavy deps
+- keep everything Tailwind-based
+- ensure no unused imports
+- ensure all components are valid modules
+
+---
+
+SUCCESS CRITERIA
+
+After this pass:
+- Tailwind works
+- layout is styled
+- homepage looks dramatically better
+- ASCII panel looks like a product artifact
+- UI feels premium and modern
+- no raw HTML fallback remains

